  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Turn latency end to end, decomposed by critical path. Complements `codex-lb-overview` (the proxy's own Postgres-derived view); every panel here is built from the wire-capture telemetry only codexlb2otel emits. codex-lb-overview's own latency panels measure the proxy's request/response cycle from Postgres; these measure the wire capture's own timing domains, including issue #23's new engine_service_* vs engine_iapi_* split (the load-balancer-relevant view: how much the two reporting vantage points diverge) and the responses_excl_* family. `$coverage` filters the five critical-path histograms (engine_wall/harness_unblocked/pre_inference/sampling_and_stream/client_tool_pause) by codexlb.critical_path.coverage - defaults to complete-only, excluding the missing_harness_boundary ~4.6% rather than silently averaging it in. `$baseline_reset` filters every delta-derived histogram the same way, default excluding baseline_reset=true (upper bounds, not measurements). Neither filter applies to codexlb.turn_duration, gen_ai.server.time_to_first_token or the three TBT histograms - none of those carry either attribute (record.go's recordDurations/recordTBT); they are shown unfiltered."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Turn latency (wire capture), p50/p90/p99",
      "description": "codexlb.turn.duration: client turn_started_at_unix_ms to server completion, real turns only. No codexlb.family, codexlb.baseline_reset or codexlb.critical_path.coverage on this instrument.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max",
            "last"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, gen_ai_request_model) (rate(codexlb_turn_duration_seconds_bucket{codexlb_family!=\"probe\", service_name=~\"$service_name\", gen_ai_request_model=~\"$model\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "refId": "A",
