    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Time between tokens: service vs iapi, and their difference, p50",
      "description": "issue #23's three TBT histograms, recorded as reported (never diffed). The service-minus-iapi series measures a difference and does go negative (min -6.70ms in the corpus) - its instrument uses explicit boundaries straddling zero (negativeCapableTBTBoundaries) so a negative reading is not absorbed into a zero-floored first bucket. None of the three carry codexlb.baseline_reset.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 46,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
